  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Immediately after you deal Sneak Attack damage to a creature on your turn, you can target a second creature you can see within 30 feet of the first. Roll half the number of Sneak Attack dice for your level (round up); the second creature takes Necrotic damage equal to the total, as wails of the dead sound around it. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Dexterity modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-TfM0JqBW0fpc6IFE\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>With Death's Lament (level 17), roll the damage for both creatures.</p></section>",
